│                                                                                                               │
│  **7-Day Travel Itinerary for Madrid, Spain**                                                                 │
│                                                                                                               │
│  **Day 1 (February 14, 2026): Arrival in Madrid**                                                             │
│                                                                                                               │
│  * Arrive at Adolfo Suárez Madrid–Barajas Airport                                                             │
│  * Take Metro Line 8 to Plaza España station (€2.50)                                                          │
│  * Check-in at Mola Hostel (dorm €15, private room €40)                                                       │
│  * Visit Mercado San Miguel for lunch and try local specialties like tortilla española and jamón ibérico      │
│  * Explore the adjacent Puerta del Sol and admire the iconic statue of King Alfonso XII                       │
│  * Enjoy traditional tapas at El Qu Jetcho (€10-15 per person)                                                │
│                                                                                                               │
│  **Day 2 (February 15, 2026): Art and Culture**                                                               │
│                                                                                                               │
│  * Visit The Prado Museum ( €12 per person)                                                                   │
│  * Admire works by Goya, Velázquez, and El Greco                                                              │
│  * Explore the adjacent Sabatini Gardens and take a stroll around the museum's beautiful courtyards           │
│  * Lunch at Café del Prado (€15-20 per person) with stunning views of the Prado Museum                        │
│  * Visit the Thyssen-Bornemisza National Museum (€12 per person)                                              │
│  * Enjoy dinner at El Prior, known for its modern Spanish cuisine (€30-40 per person)                         │
│                                                                                                               │
│  **Day 3 (February 16, 2026): Royal Palace and Retiro Park**                                                  │
│                                                                                                               │
│  * Visit the Royal Palace of Madrid ( €15 per person) during the changing of the guard ceremony (12:30 PM)    │
│  * Explore the stunning architecture and beautiful gardens                                                    │
│  * Lunch at La Huerta de San Fernando (€20-25 per person), a charming restaurant with a garden                │
│  * Relax in Retiro Park, one of Europe's largest urban parks                                                  │
